      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://kentuckylakegateway.com/carrsville-ky/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Carrsville is situated just west of the junction where Buck Creek empties into the Ohio River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
