      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carrsville%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Carrsville once housed a mill, a gas power plant, and a teachers college.",
